---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Audit booking confirmed | Efficient Labs"
  description="Your AI Sovereignty Audit booking is confirmed. Your 72-business-hour SLA clock starts now."
  canonicalPath="/audit/thank-you/"
>
  <section class="page-hero narrow">
    <h1>Booking confirmed.</h1>
    <p>Payment received. Your AI Sovereignty Audit is in queue. Confirmation and intake reference have been emailed to you.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section narrow">
    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li>The 72-business-hour SLA clock starts now.</li>
      <li>You'll receive an intake-detail follow-up within 4 business hours if we need anything additional from your stack inventory.</li>
      <li>Your PDF findings report arrives by email within 72 business hours.</li>
      <li>For Sovereign-tier bookings, we'll schedule your operator walkthrough call within the audit window.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section narrow panel">
    <h2>Need to reach us?</h2>
    <p>Reply to your confirmation email — that thread is the fastest path to a human. For urgent matters, include "URGENT" in the subject line.</p>
    <a class="button secondary" href="/">Back to home</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
